ow CSV."}, "relationships": [{"rel": "auto_has_risk", "node": "RISK:PLACEBO_DEPENDENCE"}]}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPA-058", "label": "Study family SF-APPA-058: Season stability of top suppressors and negative teammate pairs", "score": 0.479, "reached_via": ["request matches RQC:RQC-051 (0.76); FAM:SF-APPA-058 auto_addresses_question RQC:RQC-051"], "attributes": {"observed_research_question": "Season stability of top suppressors and negative teammate pairs", "auto_outcome_status": "rejected", "observed_hypothesis": "Each star's top sequential suppressor is stable across seasons, and some teammate X->Y sequences have large negative premiums.", "observed_result": "2/30 (7%) stable (>=75% same top suppressor): D. Mitchell PUTBACK 75%, L. James POST_UP 75%. Negative: J. Tatum->K. Porzingis DRIVE->SPOT_UP -0.444 n=31; Giannis->Lillard DRIVE->PNR -0.263 n=31; J. Brown->J. Tatum SPOT_U [cut; read_family for the full text]", "auto_failure_mechanism": "B_powered_null (adequately powered null result)", "observed_failure_evidence": "Only 2/30 stars meet the 75% same-top-suppressor stability rule.", "observed_sample_and_power": "30 stars x 4 seasons; min n=20/cell", "auto_validation_status": "no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED", "observed_verdict": "null"}, "relationships": [{"rel": "auto_limited_by", "node": "LIM:small_sample"}, {"rel": "auto_has_risk", "node": "RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER"}]}], "n_results": 10}

